# Maps each dev machine's hostname to the prod DB username used for remote
# connections (ema uses DBUSER as its default remote user). init-local-env.sh
# resolves the current hostname here and writes the matching user as DBUSER
# into .env. Copy to etc/dev-machines.ini (git-ignored) and fill in your
# entries. In a private fork, the file can also serve as a central team
# registry once removed from .gitignore.
# Format: hostname=dbuser

# my-hostname=mydbuser
